Carry immutable user/runtime context through direct wrappers, search helpers, ToolView, custom Python tools, hooks, parallel compositions and background work. Enforce grants at actual call boundaries, not only discovery. Define trusted custom-code limitations and local stdio owner selection. Acceptance: nested calls cannot escape owner/grant; unknown owner fails closed; existing transform/composition and output protection behavior preserved.
